Subject: [PATCH v18 15/17] smbdirect: Remove support for ITER_FOLIOQ from smbdirect_map_sges_from_iter()
Date: Tue, 17 Nov 2026 17:19:13 +0000
Message-ID: <20261117171958.2982801-16-dhowells@redhat.com>
In-Reply-To: <20261117171958.2982801-1-dhowells@redhat.com>
